# Electrostatic CGS units (ESU), from NIST SP 811 (2008), appendix B.8, and J. D. Jackson, Classical
# Electrodynamics, 3rd ed., appendix on units. Exact conversion factors to the SI units of the standard
# quantity types (F7: no new dimensions); 2997924580 is 10 c with c = 299792458 m/s.
# Format: symbol:name formula [Type]; '#' starts a comment.

@system ESU
@extends cgs.units
@include si.units

statC:statcoulomb 1|2997924580 C [ElectricCharge]
statA:statampere 1|2997924580 A [ElectricCurrent]
statV:statvolt 299.792458 V [ElectricPotential]
statΩ:statohm statV / statA [ElectricResistance]
statF:statfarad statC / statV [ElectricCapacitance]
statH:stathenry statV s / statA [ElectricInductance]

@preferred ElectricCharge statC
@preferred ElectricCurrent statA
@preferred ElectricPotential statV
@preferred ElectricResistance statΩ
@preferred ElectricCapacitance statF
@preferred ElectricInductance statH
